WEBVTT

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:30.010
Ah, thanks!

00:00:30.010 --> 00:00:31.120
You must be tired, right?

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:32.720
Y-Yeah.

00:00:37.990 --> 00:00:39.730
Captain Samonji.

00:00:39.730 --> 00:00:42.450
Something strange is going on at the Gate of No Retreat.

00:00:43.330 --> 00:00:44.550
I see.

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:55.250
Someday, in this space deprived of hope,
kono takaki mubou no kuu de itsuka

00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:59.920
you'll kneel of your own will.
sono ishi wa hiza wo tateru

00:01:08.970 --> 00:01:10.640
break up foreordination

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:11.140
Silver Will
break up foreordination

00:01:11.140 --> 00:01:11.550
Was that flame an illusion or a friend?
fake ano hi wa nakama ka
Silver Will

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:16.020
fake ano hi wa nakama ka
Was that flame an illusion or a friend?

00:01:16.270 --> 00:01:20.770
Am I to venture into the darkness?
susumu beki wa yami ka

00:01:20.770 --> 00:01:21.360
No place

00:01:21.360 --> 00:01:30.070
You'll find nameless emotions beyond the protruding knife.
knife tsukitateta saki ni shoutai no mienu kanjou

00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:35.870
I can't let this end here yet.
ima wa mada koko de owarenai

00:01:35.950 --> 00:01:41.040
I need to get ready to survive.
naraba ikiru junbi wo shiro yo

00:01:41.210 --> 00:01:46.300
The passion in my heart only burns hotter.
uzu takaku tsumiageteku netsujou

00:01:46.340 --> 00:01:49.840
Needless to say, it burdens me.
omotai ni kimatten darou

00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:50.840
wake up your tough intention
Needless to say, it burdens me.
omotai ni kimatten darou

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:51.300
wake up your tough intention

00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:52.220
Go ahead and mock my inexperience on the battlefield.
mijuku da to warau ga ii sa senjou
wake up your tough intention

00:01:52.220 --> 00:01:56.470
mijuku da to warau ga ii sa senjou
Go ahead and mock my inexperience on the battlefield.

00:01:56.560 --> 00:02:03.110
I'll show you what I've got, bit by bit,
hitotsu zutsu tashikamete yaru kara

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:04.690
so bring it on.
kakattekoi

00:02:12.780 --> 00:02:15.160
break up foreordination

00:02:21.020 --> 00:02:25.920
One Man Army

00:03:01.980 --> 00:03:02.960
Colonel Izumi!

00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:06.460
I've brought Captain Samonji of Independent Unit 8.

00:03:06.460 --> 00:03:08.380
You've arrived.

00:03:13.810 --> 00:03:16.160
I'm glad you're safe, Lieutenant.

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:18.510
Report from our scouts:

00:03:18.510 --> 00:03:23.290
the enemy is gathering 18 kilometers
to the north-northwest!

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:24.150
Understood.

00:03:26.170 --> 00:03:27.570
You heard the man.

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:32.330
What's that? A new unit?

00:03:32.330 --> 00:03:34.380
What? Can't we rest?

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:35.990
Everybody's beat...

00:03:35.990 --> 00:03:37.800
Don't look at me.

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:39.490
I hear we've been ordered.

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:41.490
Hence we're on standby.

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:43.210
No way...

00:03:43.210 --> 00:03:46.150
I hoped we'd finally be able to rest.

00:03:46.150 --> 00:03:48.880
Where are you going, Sergeant?

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:51.080
I'm going to tune the Kokuyou while I can.

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:52.950
We don't know what'll happen.

00:03:52.950 --> 00:03:55.470
She's so motivated.

00:04:02.490 --> 00:04:04.210
Um, excuse me.

00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:07.680
I'm with Kivernas Manufacturing.

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:08.830
Yes?

00:04:08.830 --> 00:04:10.900
I want to send a message to Ajuas.

00:04:10.900 --> 00:04:12.360
How can I do that?

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:15.030
Send a message?

00:04:15.030 --> 00:04:15.820
Yes.

00:04:22.790 --> 00:04:23.410
I'm sorry.

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:25.990
As you can see...

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:27.590
No way...

00:04:27.590 --> 00:04:29.250
The situation is dire.

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:32.830
The amassing Ingelmia forces are going to launch a full-scale assault

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:34.760
on this base as soon they're ready.

00:04:34.760 --> 00:04:37.270
Currently, all forces from the northwestern theater

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:39.260
are retreating through this base,

00:04:39.260 --> 00:04:42.260
but some haven't reached us yet.

00:04:42.260 --> 00:04:45.270
If I can, I'd like to save the remaining forces.

00:04:46.810 --> 00:04:49.800
Therefore, I have a special mission for Independent Unit 8.

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:53.550
From: Operation HQ

00:04:53.550 --> 00:04:55.650
To: Independent Unit 8

00:04:55.650 --> 00:05:00.280
You are to remain at this base and cover the retreat of our forces.

00:05:00.280 --> 00:05:03.320
Afterwards, initiate Order F.

00:05:03.970 --> 00:05:06.080
Seal the Gate of No Retreat!

00:05:06.870 --> 00:05:08.340
Seal the gate?

00:05:12.180 --> 00:05:13.170
Can you do it?

00:05:13.780 --> 00:05:17.190
If that is your order, there's no question.

00:05:20.240 --> 00:05:22.680
Don't act like my subordinate only when it's convenient for you.

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:35.820
You wouldn't think it's a Trail Krieger from the way it moves.

00:05:36.820 --> 00:05:38.030
It's responsive, too.

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:42.900
Arandas's new machine will be more difficult to deal with than we thought.

00:05:44.060 --> 00:05:47.330
Why is a unit like this acting independently?

00:05:47.330 --> 00:05:48.740
Who knows...

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:52.440
The other theaters have yet to report its presence.

00:05:52.440 --> 00:05:55.570
In any case, we need to know more about it.

00:05:55.570 --> 00:05:56.210
Indeed.

00:05:58.280 --> 00:06:02.050
I am Major Rontaul,
with military intelligence.

00:06:02.050 --> 00:06:04.380
What business does intelligence have?

00:06:04.990 --> 00:06:06.930
It's about that new unit...

00:06:08.120 --> 00:06:09.930
Take that file, too.

00:06:14.320 --> 00:06:19.170
All data on that new unit is considered classified.

00:06:19.170 --> 00:06:20.220
That's an order, so...

00:06:20.220 --> 00:06:22.110
Of course, we'll be happy to cooperate.

00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:26.760
If you learn anything, it would be a great help if you shared it with us.

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:28.160
Gladly.

00:06:35.630 --> 00:06:37.810
It must be hard, being a loser.

00:06:37.810 --> 00:06:38.730
Huh?

00:06:39.410 --> 00:06:40.510
Nothing.

00:06:40.510 --> 00:06:43.510
He's not interested in sharing information.

00:06:43.510 --> 00:06:45.130
Neither are we.

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:47.210
We're just not on the same page.

00:06:48.280 --> 00:06:49.950
Call Richthofen.

00:07:00.890 --> 00:07:03.070
Three of you, follow me.

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:11.940
I'm sorry, I wanted to stay too, but...

00:07:11.940 --> 00:07:16.410
Don't worry, your job is to babysit the brass.

00:07:18.320 --> 00:07:19.130
I'm kidding.

00:07:21.360 --> 00:07:24.010
I know it's stupid.

00:07:24.010 --> 00:07:25.570
I'm embarrassed to say it,

00:07:25.570 --> 00:07:27.640
but they're a mess right now.

00:07:27.640 --> 00:07:29.530
They can't agree on anything.

00:07:31.640 --> 00:07:35.680
You're the only one I can ask to do a pathetic job like this.

00:07:38.290 --> 00:07:39.330
Leave it to me.

00:07:40.110 --> 00:07:42.630
The reason this is called The Gate of No Retreat is

00:07:42.630 --> 00:07:46.320
that it's in a position to block the road between Arandas and Ingelmia.

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:50.560
It's surrounded by impassable cliffs to the east and west,

00:07:50.560 --> 00:07:54.160
and any major force must pass through this area.

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:59.460
Order F is to destroy these cliffs and prevent the enemy's passage.

00:07:59.460 --> 00:08:01.240
So that's it...

00:08:01.240 --> 00:08:03.300
I'd heard a rumor about it.

00:08:03.300 --> 00:08:09.850
Our mission is to protect this base until
the last of our allies have passed through,

00:08:09.850 --> 00:08:15.330
and then carry out order F to halt the enemy's advance.

00:08:15.330 --> 00:08:18.060
I wish you luck.

00:08:19.690 --> 00:08:21.800
Akane, are you ready?

00:08:21.800 --> 00:08:22.690
I'm okay!

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:26.880
Kaoru, bring me all the 138 millimeter
HE shells you can from the depot.

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:27.730
Right!

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:32.220
Hikaru, don't forget the
type 37 targeting alignment!

00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:34.900
Already checked it. No issues.

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:41.760
Hey, this unit is staying here until
the whole army can retreat, right?

00:08:41.760 --> 00:08:42.710
Yeah.

00:08:43.560 --> 00:08:46.840
Does that mean you're protecting the rear?

00:08:46.840 --> 00:08:48.030
Yeah.

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:52.970
What's wrong?

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:56.480
Can we really make it back?

00:08:57.840 --> 00:08:58.840
We-

00:09:06.530 --> 00:09:08.320
Don't worry.

00:09:08.320 --> 00:09:11.200
Captain Samonji won't let his men die.

00:09:27.140 --> 00:09:28.090
So that's it?

00:09:30.260 --> 00:09:32.500
The Second Lieutenant is already up there?

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:33.390
<i>Impressive.</i>

00:09:33.390 --> 00:09:34.850
I can't keep up with that.

00:09:34.850 --> 00:09:38.390
<i>Well, we're basically here for decoration.</i>

00:09:39.160 --> 00:09:42.350
<i>Trail Krieger Company 7, head out.</i>

00:09:43.360 --> 00:09:46.360
<i>Tank Company 8, advance!</i>

00:09:46.360 --> 00:09:48.990
<i>Anti-Tank Battalion 16, head out!</i>

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:55.300
Lt. Colonel, why did you order Richthofen to do force recon?

00:09:55.300 --> 00:09:56.590
There's a good chance

00:09:56.590 --> 00:09:59.550
the new enemy unit is deployed at the enemy base up ahead.

00:09:59.550 --> 00:10:00.790
That means...

00:10:00.790 --> 00:10:01.920
I see...

00:10:01.920 --> 00:10:03.080
Understood.

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:05.170
I've chosen the best man for the job.

00:10:05.170 --> 00:10:09.200
If he happens to encounter the new enemy unit during his force recon,

00:10:09.200 --> 00:10:10.470
then that's that.

00:10:10.470 --> 00:10:12.330
You're a horrible person, Lt. Colonel.

00:10:18.590 --> 00:10:20.790
How many units remain?

00:10:20.790 --> 00:10:22.460
The survivors of the 3rd Armor Battalion

00:10:22.460 --> 00:10:26.680
and the 41st mechanized infantry company are heading here.

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:28.510
They're the last ones.

00:10:28.510 --> 00:10:29.770
I see.

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:33.320
Can you get me survey data for this area?

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:36.760
I can, but what are you going to do with it?

00:10:36.760 --> 00:10:38.120
Give us some insurance.

00:10:49.510 --> 00:10:50.870
What?

00:11:04.690 --> 00:11:05.980
Out of the way!

00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:25.380
The enemy is here.

00:11:29.380 --> 00:11:32.480
Which do you think is better, AP or HE?

00:11:32.480 --> 00:11:33.840
Depends on who we're fighting.

00:11:33.840 --> 00:11:35.670
Hey, they're coming!

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:38.040
Yamanami, hurry up!

00:11:38.040 --> 00:11:39.410
Right!

00:11:43.480 --> 00:11:45.470
I'm activating Argevollen.

00:11:50.870 --> 00:11:52.460
Argevollen, device call.

00:11:52.460 --> 00:11:54.590
Starting system boot-up sequence.

00:11:54.590 --> 00:11:57.300
ID Number 06120530.

00:11:57.300 --> 00:11:59.370
Transcription: Jamie Hazaford.

00:11:59.370 --> 00:12:00.600
Active!

00:12:02.690 --> 00:12:05.490
Hey, do you have to do this every time?

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:09.020
Yup. It's just until I get back to company HQ, so deal with it.

00:12:10.650 --> 00:12:11.800
Don't break it.

00:12:14.110 --> 00:12:17.280
<i>Sergeant Silfy, Corporal Lorenz,
you are clear for departure.</i>

00:12:17.280 --> 00:12:18.870
<i>Roger. Let's go.</i>

00:12:25.550 --> 00:12:27.850
Hey, Jamie!

00:12:28.440 --> 00:12:32.090
Want to go on a date when this is over?

00:12:32.090 --> 00:12:33.150
Wh-What?!

00:12:34.490 --> 00:12:35.450
Okay?

00:12:37.920 --> 00:12:39.260
Bye!

00:12:39.260 --> 00:12:40.080
Huh?

00:12:43.520 --> 00:12:47.450
So that's Corporal Lorenz's type.

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:50.050
It's like a ritual before he goes out.

00:12:50.050 --> 00:12:51.840
He's not even serious.

00:12:51.840 --> 00:12:54.670
He just hits on everyone, doesn't he?

00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:57.400
He's never hit on me...

00:12:57.400 --> 00:12:58.590
You <i>want</i> him to?

00:12:59.120 --> 00:13:01.980
Impulse Antrieb Status: Go.

00:13:01.980 --> 00:13:03.600
Sensor array activated.

00:13:03.600 --> 00:13:06.480
Environment information synthesis confirmed.

00:13:06.480 --> 00:13:08.020
Weapon expansions online.

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:14.490
Argevollen, all systems go.

00:13:17.330 --> 00:13:20.020
<i>Private Susumu, you are clear for departure.</i>

00:13:20.020 --> 00:13:20.950
Roger.

00:13:24.460 --> 00:13:28.140
Silfy unit, Lorenz unit, and Tokimune unit are in position.

00:13:28.140 --> 00:13:30.880
The retreating forces are running late.

00:13:30.880 --> 00:13:32.040
Shall we help them?

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:33.300
No.

00:13:33.300 --> 00:13:35.010
We won't split our forces.

00:13:36.140 --> 00:13:37.010
Understood.

00:13:39.100 --> 00:13:41.800
<i>You may only provide support fire from within the base.</i>

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:43.910
<i>You are not permitted to leave the base.</i>

00:13:43.910 --> 00:13:44.810
Roger.

00:13:48.280 --> 00:13:49.350
They're here.

00:13:49.350 --> 00:13:51.850
Three Trail Kriegers.

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:54.090
The forces behind them have been wiped out.

00:14:21.400 --> 00:14:23.050
<i>Hey, now.</i>

00:14:23.780 --> 00:14:26.920
<i>You heard the order, right? Don't leave the base.</i>

00:14:26.920 --> 00:14:29.320
<i>But we have to save them.</i>

00:14:29.320 --> 00:14:29.850
<i>If you end up getting killed, we'll be in trouble.</i>

00:14:29.850 --> 00:14:32.310
If you end up getting killed, we'll be in trouble.

00:15:14.310 --> 00:15:15.340
<i>Tokimune!</i>

00:15:15.340 --> 00:15:17.570
<i>There he goes.</i>

00:15:17.570 --> 00:15:19.710
Argevollen is outside the base?

00:15:19.710 --> 00:15:21.070
What's happening with Argevollen?

00:15:21.070 --> 00:15:24.000
Come back, Private Susumu!

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:25.470
Private Susumu?

00:15:25.470 --> 00:15:27.740
Private Susumu, come back!

00:15:27.740 --> 00:15:29.030
Again?

00:15:29.030 --> 00:15:30.690
That bastard!

00:15:32.460 --> 00:15:34.630
<i>Heading 2-0, angle 1-3.</i>

00:15:34.630 --> 00:15:35.460
<i>Got it!</i>

00:15:40.590 --> 00:15:41.980
<i>Split up!</i>

00:15:48.480 --> 00:15:50.560
Heading 2-0, angle 1-6.

00:15:50.560 --> 00:15:51.680
<i>Roger.</i>

00:15:53.140 --> 00:15:55.270
<i>Get inside the base!</i>

00:15:55.270 --> 00:15:56.380
<i>Hurry!</i>

00:16:00.320 --> 00:16:01.810
<i>That's enough. Retreat.</i>

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:02.860
Roger.

00:16:24.490 --> 00:16:25.180
<i>So this...</i>

00:16:25.180 --> 00:16:27.890
is the new unit? Interesting.

00:16:33.890 --> 00:16:35.640
Argevollen is engaged with the enemy.

00:16:35.640 --> 00:16:38.730
<i>Seeker to command.
That's the enemy's main unit.</i>

00:16:44.030 --> 00:16:46.910
Suzushiro, get Tanita and
the others out of there.

00:16:46.910 --> 00:16:47.820
Roger.

00:17:02.160 --> 00:17:02.920
You move fast.

00:17:02.920 --> 00:17:05.060
Fast responses, too.

00:17:05.060 --> 00:17:05.550
But...

00:17:10.520 --> 00:17:12.990
The pilot's skill level is too low.

00:17:12.990 --> 00:17:14.020
And he's too slow to make decisions.

00:17:16.560 --> 00:17:19.230
All forces have completed their retreat.

00:17:19.230 --> 00:17:21.740
Then prepare to execute Order F.

00:17:21.740 --> 00:17:24.780
Wait! Argevollen is still out there!

00:17:24.780 --> 00:17:26.780
We can't let the main enemy force through.

00:17:28.040 --> 00:17:29.660
No...

00:17:38.500 --> 00:17:42.000
It's an unlucky machine to have a bad pilot.

00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:44.380
Damn it! Why can't I hit him?!

00:17:48.630 --> 00:17:50.890
It's time to get serious.

00:17:51.990 --> 00:17:53.640
The pilot's going to have to die,

00:17:54.500 --> 00:17:56.810
but I'm going to take that machine.

00:17:59.120 --> 00:18:01.050
We'll skip the countdown.

00:18:01.050 --> 00:18:01.650
Roger.

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:12.660
Detonate.

00:18:32.260 --> 00:18:34.550
The Gate of No Retreat is closing?

00:18:34.550 --> 00:18:37.060
<i>Pay attention, new unit!</i>

00:19:01.210 --> 00:19:03.790
I can't die in a place like this!

00:19:10.590 --> 00:19:11.800
Wait!

00:19:35.120 --> 00:19:36.120
Fire.

00:20:45.690 --> 00:20:47.730
Everyone's safe...

00:20:49.120 --> 00:20:51.690
<i>You think really have time to worry about other people?</i>

00:20:51.690 --> 00:20:53.980
<i>Cut the crap!</i>

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:56.030
<i>Never play hero again.</i>

00:20:59.450 --> 00:21:03.930
It's going to take at least two or three weeks to clear the rocks away.

00:21:03.930 --> 00:21:06.570
I can't believe they'd go this far.

00:21:06.570 --> 00:21:07.080
Lt. Colonel,

00:21:07.080 --> 00:21:10.940
Second Lieutenant Richthofen's data is ready.

00:21:10.940 --> 00:21:12.350
Understood.

00:21:12.350 --> 00:21:16.170
Now then, the immediate issue is whether

00:21:16.170 --> 00:21:19.510
the info on this new unit will be useful.

00:21:21.490 --> 00:21:22.820
Interesting!

00:21:22.820 --> 00:21:25.110
This is how war should be.

00:21:28.880 --> 00:21:32.690
The Ingelmian invasion of Arandas was halted

00:21:32.690 --> 00:21:35.570
through the efforts of Independent Unit 8;

00:21:36.570 --> 00:21:42.080
thus ensued a long stalemate.

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:40.240
Return
